    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23447" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾰπᾰν-ηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, of men, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lavish, extravagant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				564b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.6.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἑαυτόν, εἰς ἀκολασίαν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1123a4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1119b31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
				<i>expensive,</i>
			
