				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					5.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειτουργία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1309a18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1122a21
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερα, λειτουργήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1.21d
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.5.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>consuming,</i>
			
